a9y18qlte: constant-buffer deltas only from a6xx on

add_cb_deltas keeps the offset deltas of misaligned constant buffers in slot 15, the last of the 16 slots a6xx
has. Before a6xx ir3 reads constant buffers through a table of pointers in the constant file (ldg), and on the
Adreno 512 the deltas turned bgmtl_render_probe's interpolated triangle black and left its RGBA32Float targets
untouched (P4, P7, P8). With them off (RWA_CB_DELTA=0) all 18 checks pass, as on softpipe, so a pre-a6xx chip
takes the copying path by default. RWA_CB_DELTA=1 or 0 still forces either.

Assisted-by: LLM

